    "Uses this device’s local time zone. Missed runs are sent once when Alondra starts again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Usa la zona horaria local. Si se pierde una ejecución, Alondra la crea una sola vez al arrancar."}}}},
