    "waits for PR #%@ to be merged": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "espera a que se fusione el PR #%@"}}}},
    "the orchestrator is splitting it": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "el orquestador la está dividiendo"}}}},
    "finished without tasks": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "terminada sin tareas"}}}},
    "The orchestrator is splitting it into tasks.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El orquestador la está dividiendo en tareas."}}}},
    "Ask for more context": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pedir más contexto"}}}},
    "No longer pending": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ya no está pendiente"}}}},
    "This was already handled or changed. Open Alondra to see where it stands.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ya se había resuelto o ha cambiado. Abre Alondra para ver en qué punto está."}}}},
    "%@ was already handled or changed. Open Alondra to see where it stands.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ ya se había resuelto o ha cambiado. Abre Alondra para ver en qué punto está."}}}},
    "Write your answer": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Escribe tu respuesta"}}}},
    "%lld nodes": {"localizations": {"en": {"variations": {"plural": {"one": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld node"}}, "other": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld nodes"}}}}}, "es": {"variations": {"plural": {"one": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld nodo"}}, "other": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld nodos"}}}}}}},
    "Edit Again": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Editar de nuevo"}}}},
    "Discard Draft": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Descartar borrador"}}}},
    "This diff is too long to show in full. Open the PR on GitHub for the rest.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este diff es demasiado largo para mostrarlo entero. Abre la PR en GitHub para ver el resto."}}}},
    "No internet connection": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sin conexión a internet"}}}},
    "Can’t reach the Alondra server": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se puede contactar con el servidor de Alondra"}}}},
    "Your Mac isn’t answering": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no responde"}}}},
    "Alondra isn’t running on this Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no está en marcha en este Mac"}}}},
    "Your session has expired": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu sesión ha caducado"}}}},
    "This device was disconnected from your Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este dispositivo se ha desconectado de tu Mac"}}}},
    "Can’t connect right now": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ahora mismo no se puede conectar"}}}},
    "This device is offline. Alondra reconnects as soon as the network is back.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este dispositivo no tiene conexión. Alondra se reconectará en cuanto vuelva la red."}}}},
    "You’re online, but the server isn’t answering. Alondra keeps trying.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tienes conexión, pero el servidor no responde. Alondra lo sigue intentando."}}}},
    "It may be off, or Alondra may not be running on it. Alondra reconnects as soon as it answers.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Puede que esté apagado o que Alondra no esté en marcha en él. Alondra se reconectará en cuanto responda."}}}},
    "Run `alondra setup` in Terminal to start it. This window connects as soon as it answers.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ejecuta `alondra setup` en Terminal para ponerlo en marcha. Esta ventana se conecta en cuanto responda."}}}},
    "Sign in again to reconnect. Your pairing and saved work are kept.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vuelve a iniciar sesión para reconectar. Se conservan la vinculación y tu trabajo guardado."}}}},
    "Your Mac no longer accepts this device. Open Settings and link your Mac again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac ya no acepta este dispositivo. Abre Ajustes y vuelve a vincular tu Mac."}}}},
    "Something unexpected went wrong. Alondra keeps trying.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Algo inesperado ha fallado. Alondra lo sigue intentando."}}}},
    "Sign In Again": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Volver a iniciar sesión"}}}},
    "Trying again automatically…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Reintentando automáticamente…"}}}},
    "In progress": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En curso"}}}},
    "Continue without repeating": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Continuar sin repetir"}}}},
    "Review the activity before continuing.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Revisa la actividad antes de continuar."}}}},
    "View details": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ver detalles"}}}},
    "The action could not be confirmed. Check the status before trying again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se ha podido confirmar la acción. Comprueba el estado antes de volver a intentarlo."}}}},
    "The interrupted work will not be repeated. Check what was completed first; pending messages will continue.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El trabajo interrumpido no se repetirá. Revisa primero qué se ha completado; los mensajes pendientes seguirán adelante."}}}},
    "Actions already completed will not be undone. You can review the result before continuing.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Las acciones ya completadas no se desharán. Podrás revisar el resultado antes de continuar."}}}},
    "Requests are unavailable right now.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ahora mismo no se pueden enviar peticiones."}}}},
    "Continue without repeating?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Continuar sin repetir?"}}}},

    "Stop": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Detener"}}}},

    "Stop the current intervention?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Detener la intervención actual?"}}}},

    "Retry the interrupted work?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Reintentar el trabajo interrumpido?"}}}},
    "Some actions may already have completed. Check the activity and tasks before retrying to avoid repeating work.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Puede que algunas acciones ya se hayan completado. Revisa la actividad y las tareas antes de reintentar para evitar repetir trabajo."}}}},


